          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, the Cushite came; and the Cushite said, “Good tidings for my lord the king! For the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has delivered you this day from the power of all who rose up against you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king said to the Cushite, “Is it well with the young man Absalom?” And the Cushite answered, “May the enemies of my lord the king, and all who rise up against you for evil, be like that young man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
